  "worked_solution": "Let's sketch the trajectory.\n\n- We start at the given point and go along with the flow (to the left and slightly upward) until the trajectory intersects the $y$-nullcline, where the tangents are horizontal.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068149/assets/850d938e2a00d7775c20c00c7a904bd2f5d41d619c76f48fe701d187c62b11b9.png)\n\n- Next, the flow continues to the left, turning slightly downward.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068149/assets/30d303651aa2c2c10e4d57a32e5113a1d3b58f9a96b98fe8276a303675b494f6.png)\n\n- The trajectory continues to the left and down. It keeps going to infinity.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14068149/assets/f75bcf11c3e23d319b2cac2d952b28d10f24a07205a374bdf0fd1f741c2a1c01.png)",
