  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-332840\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>Let's sketch the trajectory.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We start at the given point and go along with the flow (to the left and slightly upward) until the trajectory intersects the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"208\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-nullcline, where the tangents are horizontal.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-a7c5fb0a87f16a6408e974b7d191c4d3\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/a7c5fb0a87f16a6408e974b7d191c4d3\"></div>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Next, the flow continues to the left, turning slightly downward.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-d42f08ffd4fcc06f4f455f0b7adaa2ee\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/d42f08ffd4fcc06f4f455f0b7adaa2ee\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>The trajectory continues to the left and down. It keeps going to infinity.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-8acf4dfaa359adc11cfecf53c4a8f209\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/8acf4dfaa359adc11cfecf53c4a8f209\"></div>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">  <img src=\"/graphics/q-332840-a-5\">\n</div></div>",
